/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Letsheng Holdings is an innovative enterprise founded by Kgotso Sondo in 2023, based in Mpumalanga, South Africa. Despite its headquarters being in Mpumalanga, Letsheng Holdings proudly services the entire country, offering essential services that prioritize comfort, cleanliness, and well-being. With a mission to meet the growing demand for suitable housing and cleaning solutions, the company has quickly gained recognition as a key player in the local market. Driven by the values of honesty, reliability, and affordability, Letsheng Holdings aims to create spaces and services that improve the lives of its clients.)
